---
source: crates/marion-supervisor/src/home/tests.rs
expression: screen
---
 marion  keys
  agents                                 input line
  j/k       move                         tab       next agent type
  enter     attach (pane); ^] d back     ↑↓        the type's models
  enter     full output (headless)       --detach  first on n: run it headless
  n         new task                     --<opt>   options, before the task
  s         steer a running agent        enter     run, send or add
  x         cancel, asks; again kills    esc       close it
  u         resume an ended agent
  o         shell in its workspace       setup
  d         what its branch changed      enter     harness: its detail
  m         merge its branch, asks       enter     login: make it the default
  pgup/dn   scroll output; end follows   enter     agent types: edit them
  ,         setup                        enter     notify: turn on or off
  ?         this page                    a         add a login, or a key
  q         quit                         del       remove a login or key, asks
                                         r         re-check
                                         esc       back





 esc back  j/k scroll
